# Enterprise Refactoring Prompt – Keep Infrastructure, Rebuild Business Modules

We are **NOT** building this ERP from scratch.

We are **refactoring** an existing production-level Enterprise Multi-Tenant Visa ERP + CRM.

## Objective

The current UI infrastructure is excellent and must remain unchanged.

The business flow, pages, and modules no longer match the new enterprise workflow, so only those parts must be rebuilt.

This is a **business-flow refactoring**, not a UI redesign.

---

