# Manual Workflow

This ERP is intentionally designed for manual business operations.

Do NOT automate business decisions.

Reception manually creates enquiries.

Counsellor manually updates counselling.

Counsellor manually schedules follow-ups.

Admission Officer manually verifies documents.

Finance manually records payments.

Admission Manager manually approves admission.

Faculty manually marks attendance.

The system should never automatically decide business actions.

---

