# Before Every Task

Always perform the following:

1. Analyze existing implementation.
2. Identify reusable components.
3. Identify duplicate logic.
4. Keep shared infrastructure.
5. Remove only business-specific implementation.
6. Explain business impact.
7. Explain files affected.
8. Wait for approval before generating production code.

Never recreate components that already exist.

Never redesign the UI.

Never modify the global theme.

Never modify the sidebar framework.

Never modify AG Grid styling.

Never modify the design system.

Only rebuild the business modules while reusing the existing enterprise infrastructure.


